      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huntington_Beach%2C_California",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Huntington Beach has celebrated its Fourth of July parade since 1904, a tradition that still draws crowds.",
